					"content": "哞！哞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿丑"
				},
				{
					"id": 10280807,
					"content": "聽見沒，阿丑都說妳說得對…等等，阿丑你又是幫哪邊的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荒瀧一斗"
				},
				{
					"id": 10280808,
					"content": "哞…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿丑"
				},
				{
					"id": 10280809,
					"content": "後勤是很重要的。保持充沛的體力和穩定的精神狀態，才能應對未知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10280810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "久岐忍"
				},
				{
					"id": 10280810,
					"content": "阿丑也知道這個道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
